<title>DUBAI: QUALITY - Lufthansa Sharjah Sept cargo stds.</title>
<headline>QUALITY - Lufthansa Sharjah Sept cargo stds.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lufthansa Cargo AG, an autonomous unit of Deutsche Lufthansa AG, issued its sixth monthly report on service standards achieved at its Sharjah, United Arab Emirates hub.</p>
<p>The report gives results claimed by LCAG Sharjah for September 1996.</p>
<p>Customer commitment				  Achievement</p>
<p>						 Sept 1996	August 1996</p>
<p>Flown as booked			     99 pct	   99 pct</p>
<p>Import cargo ready for pick up</p>
<p>-perishables: one hour after</p>
<p>  flight arrival			   100 pct	  100 pct</p>
<p>-general: five hours after</p>
<p>  flight arrival			   100 pct	  100 pct</p>
<p>Export acceptance waiting time	  99 pct	   99 pct</p>
<p> -up to one tonne:    one hour</p>
<p>-one to five tonnes: two hours</p>
<p>-five to ten tonnes: three hours</p>
<p>Telephone answered by third ring	93 pct	     93 pct</p>
<p>- Dubai newsroom +9714-626990</p>
</text>
